{"id":"df2e63b5f9afd0ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property.md","title":"ZFC LC Ramsey Cardinal Property","display":"df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Ramsey Cardinal Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Ramsey Cardinal Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite-subset]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Ramsey Cardinal Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset\">58-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,n,\\kappa,f,H\\in V\">\\(A,n,\\kappa,f,H\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\,\\cdot\\,]^{&lt;\\omega}:V\\to V\">\\([\\,\\cdot\\,]^{&lt;\\omega}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset\">58-df-finite-subset</a>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NSub}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{NSub}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (operator defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcRamseyCardinalProperty}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcRamseyCardinalProperty}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}finite\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NSub}(A,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in[A]^{&lt;\\omega}:\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(x,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}finite\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NSub}(A,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in[A]^{&lt;\\omega}:\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(x,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcRamseyCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},2)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(H,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists c\\in2\\;\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{NSub}(H,n)\\;f(x)=c\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcRamseyCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},2)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(H,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists c\\in2\\;\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{NSub}(H,n)\\;f(x)=c\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\in\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\in\\kappa\\)</span> excludes the countable cardinal, which also satisfies the simultaneous finite Ramsey theorem but is not a Ramsey cardinal.</li>\n<li>Finite levels and cardinality are expressed through the registered finite-subset and equinumerosity atoms; the former hidden notations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[H]^n\">\\([H]^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|H|=\\kappa\">\\(|H|=\\kappa\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f[[H]^n]|=1\">\\(|f[[H]^n]|=1\\)</span> no longer carry unregistered semantics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]), $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]]), $[\\,\\cdot\\,]^{<\\omega}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-finite-subset]]), and $\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-equinumerous]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]), $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]]), $[\\,\\cdot\\,]^{<\\omega}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-finite-subset]]), and $\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-equinumerous]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]), $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]]), $[\\,\\cdot\\,]^{<\\omega}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-finite-subset]]), and $\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-equinumerous]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]]), $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]]), $[\\,\\cdot\\,]^{<\\omega}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-finite-subset]]), and $\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-equinumerous]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,n,\\kappa,f,H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\,\\cdot\\,]^{<\\omega}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NSub}:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcRamseyCardinalProperty}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}finite\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NSub}(A,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in[A]^{<\\omega}:\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(x,n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcRamseyCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{<\\omega},2)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\exists H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nH\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(H,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists c\\in2\\;\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{NSub}(H,n)\\;f(x)=c\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\in\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"[H]^n","display":false},{"tex":"|H|=\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"|f[[H]^n]|=1","display":false}],"bytes":1965,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2454","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property.md|58-df-zfc-lc-ramsey-cardinal-property]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751","130f2eb9510d97cd","28c79fde9f892bfe"]}